---

## Methodology Overview
The project reviews common interpretability approaches discussed in the literature, including:
- Probing-based analysis
- Attention-based interpretability
- Causal and mechanistic interpretability methods

A simple probing setup is used to illustrate how linguistic information can be extracted from internal model representations.

---

## Scope and Limitations
This project focuses on conceptual understanding and analysis rather than large-scale experimental evaluation.  
The implemented prototype is illustrative and does not aim to reproduce full benchmark results.

---

